{"id":"n24591-3-8","stage":3,"title":"조명 · 舞台照明","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24591-3-8-1","ko":"연극 마지막 장면 정말 멋지지 않았어?","zh":"戏剧的最后一幕真的非常精彩，对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"연극","meaning":"话剧，戏剧","explanation":"연극：话剧，戏剧","readings":[{"term":"연극","audio":"/audio/ca8deda3ff79221b26a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13977","senseId":"1","lemma":"연극","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마지막","meaning":"最后，最终，末了","explanation":"마지막：最后，最终，末了","readings":[{"term":"마지막","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28843","senseId":"1","lemma":"마지막","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장면","meaning":"场面","explanation":"장면：场面","readings":[{"term":"장면","audio":"/audio/5727c93714b0d8b05307.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24815","senseId":"2","lemma":"장면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"멋지지","meaning":"帅气，潇洒，优秀","explanation":"멋지다：帅气，潇洒，优秀；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"멋지다","audio":"/audio/2b6551da3926436a9395.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15991","senseId":"1","lemma":"멋지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않았어?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ca8deda3ff79221b","term":"연극","zh":"话剧，戏剧","audio":"/audio/ca8deda3ff79221b26a4.mp3","entryId":"13977","definition":"演员在舞台上照着剧本向观众展示演技的行为。","pronunciation":["연ː극"]},{"id":"8da62ef6312ba9ce","term":"마지막","zh":"最后，最终，末了","audio":"/audio/8da62ef6312ba9ce3e2e.mp3","entryId":"28843","definition":"在时间上或次序上的末尾。","pronunciation":["마지막"]},{"id":"5727c93714b0d8b0","term":"장면","zh":"场面","audio":"/audio/5727c93714b0d8b05307.mp3","entryId":"24815","definition":"电影或戏剧的瞬间、情景。","pronunciation":["장면"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"2b6551da3926436a","term":"멋지다","zh":"帅气，潇洒，优秀","audio":"/audio/2b6551da3926436a9395.mp3","entryId":"15991","definition":"很好或很美。","pronunciation":["먿찌다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/ae637d4881437ebe3e58.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24591-3-8-2","ko":"응. 조명을 받은 배우가 정말 멋있더라.","zh":"嗯。在灯光照耀下的演员看起来真的太棒了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조명을","meaning":"舞台照明，舞台灯光","explanation":"조명：舞台照明，舞台灯光；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"조명","audio":"/audio/ef57d3c8ccf339e7a4f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24591","senseId":"3","lemma":"조명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받은","meaning":"受，晒，吹","explanation":"받다：受，晒，吹；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"8","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배우가","meaning":"演员","explanation":"배우：演员；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배우","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58204","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말",